    <books>{
      # The Helios Drift Incident

      The Helios Drift Incident was a cascading navigation disaster involving the deep-space colony vessel HSV Helios in 2144.

      ## Major Systems

      | System | Description |
      |---|---|
      | DriftCore | Autonomous route correction engine |
      | Vector Spine | Spatial navigation graph |
      | Relay Mesh | Inter-ship communication system |
      | Echo Vault | Black box telemetry archive |

      ## Layout Contract

      ```netiv
      °define •selectorPanel: •string = "left sidebar";
      °define •viewportPanel: •string = "main viewport";
      °define •renderMode: •string = "netiv-wiki";
      ```

      ## Legacy Notes

      - The incident permanently changed interstellar navigation standards.
      - The wiki page should render from the selected Netiv document, not a hardcoded article shell.
    };
